OL,3,CMultiple firefighters battling large
OL,4,Chill fire near Rhayader
OL,6,FMultiple firefighters are reported to
OL,7,Fbe responding to a large hill fire in
OL,8,FPowys.
OL,10,FA blaze has broken out on Gwastedyn
OL,11,FHill, located just above the town of
OL,12,FRhayader.
OL,14,FCrews from Rhayader, Llandrindod
OL,15,FWells, Builth Wells, Newtown,
OL,16,FAberystwyth, Llanfair Caereinion,
OL,17,FWelshpool, Knighton and Llanfyllin are
OL,18,Fin attendance.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G1/3
