OL,3,CMultiple firefighters battling large
OL,4,Chill fire near Rhayader
OL,6,FIn a statement, Mid and West Wales
OL,7,FFire and Rescue Service said: "At
OL,8,F14:32pm on Wednesday 12th August, Mid
OL,9,Fand West Wales Fire and Rescue Service
OL,10,Fwere called to a wildfire in the Nant
OL,11,FGlas, Llandrindod Wells area.
OL,13,F"Crews from Rhayader, Llandrindod
OL,14,FWells, Builth Wells, Llanidloes,
OL,15,FNewtown, Aberystwyth, Llanfair
OL,16,FCaereinion, Welshpool, Knighton and
OL,17,FLlanfyllin were and are still in
OL,18,Fattendance.
OL,20,F"The fire has been sectorised and
OL,21,Fcrews are making good progress.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G2/3
